{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5LzEwRSUyMCUyODIwMTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"10E","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6u4EVkx1G2bNEGuv5GBi25VmkZd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDdP7eFjy6gNe29lRSjwwAyWRyy.jpg","description":"A few years after her mother's passing, 17-year old Tennie's reputation at school takes a major hit before the prom. To further complicate the daily rigors of teenage life, her father, Robert, an advertising executive who has since rebuilt his business, tries to do the same with his relationship with his daughter. Against his therapist's advice, overeager Robert tries really hard to get close to Tennie by showing his own way of caring. He tries to find out about his daughter's personal life with the help of his newly appointed, 19 year-old driver/intern, Jack. Practically being raised by her extended family, Tennie although very academically inclined and mature for her age, with compassion for others, she's got a touch of sarcasm, and a hint of rebelliousness. After she catches on to her father's plan, Tennie realizes that in order to get her father off of her back, she needs to convince him to find a lady friend.\n\nReleased 19 Sept 2019 · US · Language: English · 94 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.3","imdb_id":"tt10379006","moviedb_id":697407,"tmdbId":697407,"runtime":"94 min","cast":["Vahik Pirhamzei","Poema Oleas Mekhitarian","Karina Piliguian","Angelo Diona","Peter Nishan","Anna Chart","Tanya Avakian","Anahid Avanesian"],"director":["Vahik Pirhamzei"],"writer":["Menua Minasian","Vahik Pirhamzei"],"released":"2019-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","country":"US","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vahik Pirhamzei","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s1JZXJrorsLOzFzdcL5hIbfi70A.jpg"},{"name":"Vahik Pirhamzei","character":"Robert